      "sourceTextSha256": "9c863fb6b2256864ed1d21a7602c41c618288cddb3bf29d6b13be7d7f589d412",
      "text": "After a continental breakfast, you will embark on a shared snorkeling adventure. The day includes feeding tarpon, visiting a sunken barge, snorkeling at Hol Chan Marine Reserve, swimming with nurse sharks and stingrays at Shark Ray Alley, and exploring Coral Gardens. Lunch is included during the excursion, and you will return in the afternoon.",
